<section class='container xxnarrow margin-center'>
  <h2 class="as-h3">Meet the buyers.</h2>
  <p>StereoBuyers is a locally owned, family-run business in NYC, focused on buying pre-owned audio equipment.</p>
  <p>But truth be told, we’re more than that. We are music lovers. Sound hounds. Audiophiles. Drawn to the warm glow of a vacuum tube, seduced by the soft crackle of a phono cartridge, and firm believers that no speakers are too big and no record collection is too vast.</p>
  <p>We’re proud to have turned our love for music and technology into a team built on professionalism, trust, and a high-end level of service that might surprise you. If you have A/V equipment to sell, we invite you to check us out – fill out a <a href="/get-a-quote/">quote form</a> to get started.</p>
</section>
